WEBVTT

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:07.130
And so, the Sakuramori Festival will take place starting tomorrow.
<i>Sakuramori Festival</i>

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:13.130
Please keep everything in moderation, behave yourself as a proud student of Sakuramori, and have fun.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.090
Sado-kun.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:19.350
Chairman?

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:23.350
If I remember correctly... you were in the Second Volunteering Club, right?

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.390
Will you be having a stall as well?

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.570
We're going to set up a "Trouble Resolving Booth" in order to advertise our club.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:32.990
Is that so...

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.950
If you have any issues you'd like to solve,
you'll be more than welcome.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.410
I-I don't have anything in particular...

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:43.500
I'll be occupied with executive committee work anyway.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.410
Excuse me.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:49.630
Well, I guess staying out of trouble is a good thing.

00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:57.760
Help!!

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:07.140
Chu-ru-Chu-Chu-Chu... YES!! Help U

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:13.360
Hey you lost boy, with a face full of despair

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.570
If you throw out the straw you're leaning on,

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:18.660
I guess that can't be helped either?

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.910
Fate is (straying away)

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:23.080
Being mean again today (going beserk)

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:28.960
At least I want to be on your side, but what can I do?

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:32.040
NO!! Jesus crisis! Oh My God!

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:34.090
Try leaving it to me

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:36.260
YES!! Chu-ru-Chu-Chu-Chu Help U

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:38.510
Just getting there is too weak,

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:41.100
get destroyed to nothing and then?

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:45.770
DNA is stubborn. Overdoing isn't allowed.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:48.140
With 5 seconds remaining I ended it forcefully (right before)

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:50.350
Feeling like getting reborn? (no way)

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:55.190
If we do the hands-on-approach rehab; you'll go to HEAVEN

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:57.490
Without even letting you say yes

00:01:57.490 --> 00:01:59.780
With these hands

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:03.660
I'll fix you up right away

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:08.250
A little fall in love feeling bigger than your presence is

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:13.170
making me unable to leave you alone with that miserable face.

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:17.380
I made it a meeting to change your outlook on life.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:22.470
So just start going along with the flow

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:25.560
I'm off to HELP YOU!

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:51.540
Just what the hell is this supposed to mean?

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.550
No one's coming, huh?

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.670
Oh yeah, where's Yuuno?

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:02.010
I got a text from her saying she's going to be late.

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:05.260
She was worried because she couldn't get in contact with you.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:07.600
Oh! I forgot my cellphone...

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:12.690
A-A-Are you the ones who solve people's troubles?

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:15.650
Yes, we are! Leave everything to me!

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:19.530
Huh? Is that you, Sado-kun?

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:20.990
An acquaintance of yours?

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:24.370
He's the manager of the convenience store I work at.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:29.080
My lover Ruri-Ruri's gone missing!

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.750
A lover gone missing?

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.330
That sounds like a major case for us!

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:36.460
I took my eyes off her for a second, and she was gone!

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.000
A lover?

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.840
Don't you mean the body pillow you bought the other day?

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:42.260
What are you saying?!

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.930
Ruri-Ruri is no body pillow!

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:47.050
She's my precious lover!

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:50.890
Ruri-Ruri...

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:54.940
His sole interest is the 2D world;
a very unique manager, as you can see.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:59.690
So basically he's some random creep who believes a body pillow is his lover...

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:02.190
Why don't you go look for it yourself, moron!

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:03.700
Here you go.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.870
The Cat Café, now in business!
Museum of Fortune Telling

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.320
We'd love it if you could pay us a visit!

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:11.830
Oh! I'd like to go check it out with Tarou.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:17.290
I see. So this is where you lost your body pillo- I mean, Ruri-Ruri...

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:20.380
She probably got kidnapped!

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:24.590
Actually... I think we should handle it as lost property...

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.340
What are you doing?

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:31.180
There she is!

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.930
I missed you so!

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.310
Ruri-Ruri!

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:41.530
I'm so sorry! You were lonely, right?!
I'll never leave you alone again, you hear me?!

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.190
So it was his, huh?

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:45.990
We wanted to treat it as an unidentified object and were about to throw it out.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:48.700
Sado-kun.

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:53.200
I'd like to discuss something... with the Second Volunteering Club, that is.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.710
If you're looking for Pig-boy, he's gone to pick up some lost property.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:00.250
Oh, I see...

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.210
I'll go look for him then!

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:06.470
Senpai!

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:08.840
Here, have a look at this!

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:12.770
It's a threat letter that was mailed to the
Executive Committee of the Sakuramori Festival!

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.100
A threat letter?!

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:20.900
"Heed my word, cursed students: misfortune shall fall upon you for all the great sins you've committed.

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.570
As a matter of course, you are obliged to accept the punishment."

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:28.280
Apparently, they want us to aid them in capturing the culprit before anything happens.

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:31.030
Well, I think it's just a prank, but...

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:35.750
Yes! This is the perfect case for me!

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.040
Get a move on! We're going, Pig-boy!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.500
W-We're going? Where to?!

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:47.380
And? How are we going to find the culprit?

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.090
Whoa... Senpai?

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.220
Hold on for a second.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.760
Did you notice someone suspicious?

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:56.350
57 yen...

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:59.230
What's wrong?

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:00.190
Pig-boy.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:03.520
What about that?

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:06.860
You, treat me to a crêpe!

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:07.780
What?

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:11.780
Hurry up and go already, you fucking slowass swine!

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.700
Sure!

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:18.710
Thank you for your purchase!

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.550
It's so delicious!

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:28.010
That's great.

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:32.050
An opening!

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.930
Senpai! What are you doing?

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:38.930
So you have chocolate, huh?

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:40.520
That one's good, too!

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:42.020
You think so?

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:50.280
If you really want to eat it that much, go ahead.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.570
Really?!

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:53.530
Yay! YAY!

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:58.290
Oh, it's so tasty!

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:00.080
Second Volunteering Club
<b>Patrolling
around
school</b>

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.710
How could they...

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:05.170
Tarou... Where are you?

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:10.800
Tako, tako, tako, tako, takoyaki!

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:16.310
It's the delish, naughty takoyaki!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.100
It's good, isn't it?

00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:27.020
But now I feel thirsty.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.320
Are you going force me to treat you again?

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:31.070
Free drinks coupon

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:33.320
This time, I'll treat you.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:33.660
Free drinks coupon

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:35.910
C'mon! We're off, Pig-boy!

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.030
Sure, sure...

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:51.340
This looks like the kind of place Yuuno would like to visit.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:52.470
Right, Senpai?

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:54.720
Senpai...?

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:56.140
No...

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:57.180
Huh?

00:07:58.720 --> 00:07:59.640
No...

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.770
But you said drinks were free here...

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:05.350
I don't want to! I just can't!

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:11.530
Hey! Wait up, Senpai!

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:14.910
Tarou...

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:17.490
There you are, Arashiko!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:19.580
Let's go look around together!

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:20.240
Okay?

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.250
Oh, Yumi...

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:27.420
What's the matter, Senpai?

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:29.290
It's nothing!

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:33.550
Putting this aside, I hope you haven't forgotten about our mission, Pig-boy.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:34.880
Our mission...?

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:39.890
The request for the Second Volunteering Club, you dumbass!

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:44.230
Oh, right! Indeed! We were patrolling around school!

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:47.350
What's going on?

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:49.730
Looks like the beauty pageant's starting.

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:58.450
It's possible that... they're planning to use a big event like this one as their stage to show off the execution of their plan!

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.200
Huh? Hey, wait...

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:04.160
All right, moving on! Entry number five: Tatsumi Antoinette XVI!

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.120
Tatsumi Antoinette XVI
Entry number 05

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:07.330
All right, moving on! Entry number five: Tatsumi Antoinette XVI!

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:13.670
I'm certain you bunch of lowlifes are already aware of the fact...

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:19.180
...that the person with the most exquisite looks in all of Sakuramori High School is none other than me.

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:24.890
Come, commoners! Admire my beauty with all your body and soul!

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:28.600
What the hell is that disgusting freak up to?

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:32.860
Now moving on! Entry number six: Shizuka-san. Come on up!

00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:38.280
Is everyone rocking out?! Shizuka is here!

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:42.530
Wha-?! Wh-What is <i>she</i> doing here?

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:46.500
I'm gonna try my best and win this thing, all right?!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:50.460
The prize for first place... What was it again?

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.500
A pair coupon for a hot spring.

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:53.630
Crap, this is bad...

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:55.420
She's serious about this.

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.970
Everyone, don't be fooled!

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:59.470
Is that voice...?!

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:00.220
Sado   Shizuka
Economics, Department of Economics
Kinmei University        Student ID

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:01.970
Please have a look at this.

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:07.230
Shizuka-san might be minuscule in size, but she's still a cited university student.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:09.980
She's not a student of Sakuramori High!

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:13.980
Dammit, that old hag... Revealing it right here.

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:16.740
This is a complete fraud.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:19.110
Please take care of it right away.

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:25.120
And here I am, Tomoko, your prospective champion!

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:25.990
Yay!

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:28.000
M-Mother...

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:31.500
Peace, peace, peace!

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:33.420
Nooo!

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:36.510
I'm still a spry, genuine high school student!

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:41.180
What's with that woman calling herself a high school student? I question her sanity...

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.650
<i>World's Cosplay
Photo Studio</i>

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:56.980
Oh? A threat letter?
<i>World's Cosplay
Photo Studio</i>

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:59.280
Well, that sure isn't too comforting.

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:03.700
But we just can't figure out how to catch the culprit.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.580
Hm... Cursed students, eh?

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:10.250
I'm somehow getting a certain sense of horror out of it.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:14.380
I still think it's just a prank by someone who enjoys that sort of stuff.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:19.670
Speaking of horror, I hear the Inventor's Club's haunted house was quite well-made.

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.800
A haunted house...

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:24.180
Oh, that's good! Priceless!

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:26.050
Right, now strip off the jacket a bit more...

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:26.260
The Inventor's Club, huh?

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:28.180
Yes! That's perfect!

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:30.600
Aww! They're so cute!

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.980
It's so soothing!

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:35.400
There we go... Does it feel good?

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:36.060
Is it here? Or here~?

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:38.110
I can't even get through to him on his cell...

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:38.570
Is it here? Or here~?

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:41.030
Tarou, what are you doing?

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:41.610
Haunted House

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:44.620
So this must be the rumored haunted house.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:48.540
It's dark inside, and no one would suspect anything when hearing screams emerging from here.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:51.160
It's the perfect stage for a tragedy.

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:52.790
Do you really think so...?

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.920
Welcome to the Inventor's Club's Haunted House!

00:11:57.920 --> 00:12:01.800
This place is a masterpiece created by collecting the essence of science!

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.680
Please, come right this way.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:11.270
You haven't even entered and you're already freaking out! Now hurry up and move!

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:13.190
Senpai! Stop pushing me!

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:19.860
Quite professionally made, isn't it?

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:22.240
Couldn't expect anything less from the Inventor's Club.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.320
Nooo! It's here!

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:31.120
Please, don't!

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:34.120
You seriously are a worthless pile of fail, aren't you?

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.630
How can you possibly not mind this at all?

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:39.800
I'm honestly scared here.

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:45.430
There's something over there!

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:47.220
You're helpless...

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:50.060
Ah, wait up! Senpai!

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:52.220
Don't walk so fast...

00:12:58.980 --> 00:12:59.690
Huh?

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:03.150
I guess this is supposed to be a monster cat, right?

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:05.700
That aside, it looks quite cute.

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:06.990
Cat...

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:07.530
What?

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:08.990
Cat... Cat...

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:11.830
Senpai... Could you be...?

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:13.330
I hate cats!

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:13.830
So you were afraid of cats?

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.160
I'm begging you! Go away!

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.830
Then that's the reason why you earlier...

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:19.670
Uh, come on! Go away!

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:22.840
Senpai, it's okay.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.760
The cat's gone now.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:31.640
Senpai?

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.350
Cat... Cat...

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:36.310
I was so scared!

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:41.570
It's all right now, please stop crying. Okay, Senpai?

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:46.280
You're not too good with those kinds of places, right?

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:47.860
Y-Yeah...

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.450
Let's go somewhere else then!

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.820
Wait for me!

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.700
Pig-boy.

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:56.460
Yes?

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:59.790
I'll... hold your hand.

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:02.670
You're scared of ghosts, aren't you?

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:06.010
That's why I'm telling you that I'll hold your hand.

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:13.350
Yes, please do.

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:17.060
G-Guess I don't have a choice, huh?

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:19.850
Here, now hurry up!

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:32.780
Huh?

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:34.530
Pig-boy?

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:42.500
Wha-?!

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:44.920
What's this supposed to be?!

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.170
Welcome,

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.260
cursed student.

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:51.890
Wh-Who are you guys?

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:58.480
Chairman!

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:01.310
Here, I am not the chairman.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:02.350
Huh?

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:07.150
I am the president of MFC, Ayasegawa Kirino.

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:09.360
And these are my comrades.

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:11.570
MFC...?

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:13.620
MFC is...

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:17.120
...the abbreviation for the Mio-sama Fan Club!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:22.460
Right... And uh, what do you...

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:26.670
Last year, Mio-sama won the title of Miss Sakuramori High School.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:30.300
We admire and worship her splendid beauty.

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:33.970
We're an organization that punishes those who dare to denigrate Mio-sama.

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.800
Punishment...?

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:39.430
Were you the one who wrote that threat letter?!

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:42.520
Where did you take Pig-boy?!

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:44.770
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:47.730
If you don't spit out the answer, I'll hang you from the rooftop!

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.360
H-How could you...

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:52.530
What's that?

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:53.450
What?

00:15:56.160 --> 00:15:57.370
Pig-boy!

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:01.200
I'll ask you frankly.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.830
Are you...

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:08.250
...and Mio-sama going out?

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.210
Come again?

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:14.590
According to our information, you were on a date with Mio-sama once before.

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:16.930
A date?

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:26.940
That was...

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:30.650
On top of that, today at Sakuramori Festival...

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:36.160
It turned out that way because you wrote that eerie threat letter...!

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:40.540
Thus, is it correct to assume you and Mio-sama aren't lovers?

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.080
Yeah.

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:45.620
I'm relieved to hear that.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:50.210
Oh, cursed student. Accept your punishment.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:55.630
If you two were lovers, it would have been sad, but we'd give up.

00:16:56.090 --> 00:17:00.140
Mio-sama's smile, expression full of sorrow, or anger...

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:04.430
Even if you were to monopolize it, it'd be only natural to do so.

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:05.890
However!

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:10.230
You're nothing more than a subordinate in her club!

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:13.240
And yet you have Mio-sama all to yourself.

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:15.150
That's unacceptable!

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:17.950
You're an eyesore.

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:21.370
Standing lower than a piece of crap stuck to the bottom of Mio-sama's soles,

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:26.120
yet flirting with her during the entire Sakuramori Festival, eh? You miserable shit!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.630
I will not forgive you.

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.130
Not good...

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:35.840
If I get that, I'll certainly, most definitely, assuredly rise to my hella masochism...

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:38.640
Now, it's punishment time!

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:39.890
Please wait!

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:42.390
This isn't something Senpai would wish for!

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:46.890
What do you know about Mio-sama? You're not even dating!

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:49.730
All Senpai ever wanted to do was to grant wishes.

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.860
Admiration and worship has nothing to do with it! That's why...!

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:54.230
Shut up!

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:57.030
Pig-boy! Are you okay?

00:17:57.570 --> 00:17:59.160
Senpai!

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:03.120
M-Mio-sama...

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:06.290
Who are you people?

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.670
Kidnapping Pig-boy like that... What were you planning to do?

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:11.380
What's your goal?!

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:16.840
R-Right... I'm the president of the Mio-sama Fan Club, Ayasegwa Kirino.

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:19.800
Huh? Mio-sama Fan Club?

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:28.390
We praise your beauty, we admire and worship you.

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:31.150
Wh-What are you going on about?

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:34.110
I'm telling you, I don't need any worship or admiration!

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:35.980
M-Mio-sama...

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:38.610
We've received Mio-sama's words!

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.570
Oh, how fearless she looks!

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:43.070
And we're standing so close to her!

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:46.200
What on Earth... are they?

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:48.200
Senpai...

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.370
You came to help me, right?

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:57.760
You shouldn't let go of my hand when I'm willing to hold onto it for you. Got that?

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:58.800
Do you understand?

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:00.010
I do.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:05.640
Mio-sama, we're truly sorry for the difficulties we've caused you.

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:10.100
We'll... disband the MFC at once.

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:10.890
What?

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:14.900
We have accomplished our mission.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:16.820
Everyone,

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:19.690
I thank you for all your effort during all this time!

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:22.070
Prez!

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:24.120
Likewise! Thank you very much!

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:25.870
It was a lot of fun.

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:27.990
Hooray for MFC!

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:28.950
Hooray!

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:30.040
Is it my fault?

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:30.790
Hooray!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:30.960
Shouldn't you say something to them?

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:32.250
Hooray!

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:32.750
Shouldn't you say something to them?

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:34.080
Hooray!

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:35.920
I guess I'll have to.

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:40.300
Hey, you lot! If you do something bizarre again,
you won't get away with it easily!

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:41.420
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:44.800
If you have a wish you'd like granted,
make your way to the Second Volunteering Club!

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.640
Thank you for your kindness!

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:48.060
Well then, dismissed!

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.890
Thank you very much!

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:02.700
So I heard you were the Miss Sakuramori last year.

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:04.200
Well, yeah.

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:09.120
And the prize was a pair coupon for a hot spring, was it?

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:13.330
Um, who did you go with?

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.290
What? Does it bother you?

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.920
Well, no. I didn't exactly mean it that way...

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:20.380
I went with Michiru-nee.

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:24.630
Isn't it up to me to decide who I go with?

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:27.100
What is it?

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:29.350
Oh, it's nothing.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:32.140
Oh well, it's fine.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.560
Thanks... for today.

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:37.940
Excuse me?

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:45.030
Right...

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:54.120
Tarou...

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:55.040
Mio-san...

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:57.290
Arashiko?!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:21:00.380
You two look like... you're having fun together.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:04.800
Tarou and Mio-san... I guess you two were together the whole day today.

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:08.180
And even holding hands...

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:10.140
Uh, no! That's um...
No, that's not true! That's because Pig-boy-!

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:17.060
I wanted to hold hands and... go look around with Tarou, too!

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:20.320
Yuuno?

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:26.030
Nooo! Don't touch me!

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:29.320
You were the one who touched me first, though!

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:31.830
This is bad.

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:35.750
Don't get your masochism fired up at a place like this!

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:37.210
That feels great!

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:40.130
Everyone's going to find out about his masochism at this rate.

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:41.840
We're going to knock him out!

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:43.420
Arashiko, you help out too.

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:47.050
I don't really get what's going on, but okay!

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:50.470
Men are scary!

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:55.520
I really am blessed!

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:58.940
It's still not enough, love me love me!

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:01.520
At least I have to achieve it even by force?

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:02.190
by force

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:04.860
After I take a deep breath, it's confession time.

00:22:04.860 --> 00:22:07.530
But here I am, being uneasy.

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:11.410
It has to be special. It is special. Banzai!

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:12.700
Yay! Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:14.040
Do you not like being close?

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:15.370
Or...do you like it?

00:22:15.370 --> 00:22:18.080
Approach, then retreat, the front of the back

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:20.670
Fear and happiness might be similar.

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:22.840
I want to approach you, I like you.

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:23.340
Right?

00:22:23.340 --> 00:22:24.630
I'm bad at loving and adoring.

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:25.960
It's a purely one-sided

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:27.300
bullet-like counseling being downloaded.

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:28.590
That's right! That's right!

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:29.930
In love and romance, tension is needed.

00:22:29.930 --> 00:22:33.300
Pure hearted aggression and artistry needs to combined.

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:36.060
I want to dream

00:22:36.060 --> 00:22:39.980
It can't be helped if I become hated, but...

00:22:39.980 --> 00:22:45.940
In my eyes, you're glittering

00:22:46.730 --> 00:22:48.900
Why?

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:50.700
I know... Teach me please

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:53.160
But make a firm choice, love you love you!

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:55.660
There's only one seat so take it by force!

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:56.290
by force

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:56.620
It's still not enough, love me love me!
by force

00:22:56.620 --> 00:22:58.410
It's still not enough, love me love me!

00:22:58.410 --> 00:23:01.080
At least I have to succeed but my heart aches.

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:06.800
Anyways, my feelings just won't stop.

00:23:06.800 --> 00:23:08.880
Make a firm choice! Love you! Love you!

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:11.470
At least, I have to take a chance! I have to!

00:23:11.470 --> 00:23:12.140
I have to!

00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:14.760
Take a deep breath, and now it's decision time.

00:23:14.760 --> 00:23:17.390
I want you to have peace of mind, so pick me

00:23:17.390 --> 00:23:21.350
Because it's special. You're special...Push it!

00:23:21.350 --> 00:23:23.610
yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah!!

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:28.400
It's interesting, isn't it?

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:31.650
I don't get why Sado-kun fails to understand its greatness.

00:23:31.650 --> 00:23:33.400
He's missing out in life, don't you think so?

00:23:33.420 --> 00:23:37.020
And the 2D girls are so appealing!

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:38.040
Guys, 2D girls would always be your first choice, right?

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:40.290
Miss Sadistic Arashiko
